    {
        "content": "<p>As a short answer, this is an intentional change. You might have noticed that I changed the <code>rfl</code> to a <code>with_reducible_and_instances rfl</code> in the <code>example</code>; that's because that's what actually happens (since v4.29.0) when unifying instances (in this case the competing instances for <code>Top (SubSemigroup α)</code>). To fix the problem, tag <code>giGenerate</code> with <code>@[implicit_reducible]</code>. There's probably more information in the release announcement.</p>",
        "id": 583331036,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1775155342
    },
    {
